Resume Mamba state in the Mamba group's own token geometry.

The shared generic block_size can describe a differently quantized drafter, so
using it to resume puts the prefix-state column and the prefill chunk
boundaries in the wrong place. Take the geometry from the Mamba group instead,
as preprocess_state already does for subsequent steps.

